"`src/cadrumo/application/runtime`, totaling 5,292 lines, 196,454 bytes, "
"and 40,876 measured `o200k_base` proxy tokens. All eight bounded-reader "
"pages and assigned ranges were read. Static inspection only; no "
"application execution or tests were run. Runtime transport types describe"
" protocol boundaries; this chunk does not establish behavior of platform-"
"specific transport or storage adapters."
msgstr ""
